  "description": "Primary interactive control used to trigger actions, submit forms, or open modals and sheets.\n\nVariants & Properties:\n- Content: Label | Icon.\n- Variant: Primary | Outline | Ghost | Destructive.\n- Size: LG | MD | SM | XS.\n- State: Default | Hover | Focus | Disabled.\n- Properties: ✏️ Text, 👁️ Icon Left, ↪️ Swap Icon Left, 👁️ Icon Right, ↪️ Swap Icon Right, Swap Icon.\n\nHierarchy & usage rules:\n- Never place two Primary buttons side by side inside a Dialog, Sheet, Card, or Date & Time Picker; always pair 1 main action button (Primary or Destructive) with 1 secondary button (Outline or Ghost for Cancel/Reset).\n- Do not use as a static status indicator (use Badge) or primary page navigation (use Sidebar Navigation, Topbar, or Tab).",
